     "title": "Changes",
     "items": [
      {
       "text": "Hey everyone,",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We wanted to share a quick update about the This Is Fine: Maximum Cope demo that was planned to go live for Steam Next Fest yesterday. In classic Question Hound fashion, a technical issue has delayed the release a couple days.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "We’re working with Steam to get everything resolved and the demo published as soon as possible. Once it’s live, we’ll be extending the demo period beyond Next Fest so everyone still has plenty of time to play, explore, and share feedback.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "🔥 Everything’s (almost) fine.",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
       "pcOnly": false,
       "category": "other"
      },
      {
       "text": "-Numskull Games Team",
       "ps5ProOnly": false,
